{
  "about": "a request's emit the gateway accepted, whose answer never reached the client, is sent again inside emitRetry with the key and the envelope it was first sent with; the gateway answers the repeat as it answered the first, and the request resolves with the response of its reply",
  "source": "protocol/contract/TRANSPORT-HTTP.md § Emitting; protocol/specs/src/paths/bus_emit.json; protocol/specs/src/client/timing.json emitRetry",
  "steps": [
